# Fillet edges round a rounded outline (an extension): a rectangle with
# a corner rounded by Sketch > Tangent Arc at Point, extruded; one top
# side picked and New Group > Fillet Edges rounds it and goes on round
# the arc and the next side, which it meets smoothly, ending at the
# sharp corners. Check Solid finds it sound, and again at a new radius.
